+# Review of the door check-in change
+
+- major | Guestbook/Store/GuestStore.swift:73 | `try?` discards the failure of the ledger write. When the write fails (disk full, file protection while the device is locked), the ledger silently misses check-ins and staff export an incomplete list. Catch the error, log it without personal data, and set `lastError` as `persist()` does.
+- major | Guestbook/Views/GuestListView.swift:19 | Check-in is reachable only through a double-tap gesture, with no button, swipe action, or accessibility action. VoiceOver, Voice Control, and Switch Control users cannot check guests in. Add a swipe action or `accessibilityAction(named:)` for check-in.
